    <briefdescription>
<para>The default (manual heuristics) implementation of the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_inline_advisor" kindref="compound">InlineAdvisor</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This implementation does not need to keep state between inliner pass runs, and is reusable as-is for inliner pass test scenarios, as well as for regular use. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
